<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμισθ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without hire</i> or
				<i>pay,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμισθος</span>:
			hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>unpaid, unhired,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					979
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				829
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπη, ἄ. ξυνέμπορος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					733
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θως,</span> Cret. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					5125
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Oaxos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>without paying,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMeretr.</u>
				12.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
